31,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning. I hope everyone slept peacefully. Now that the first night has passed, I wonder if any truths have come to light?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Good morning. Since the Seer now has information, I'm curious if anyone is willing to share their findings or if they've noticed anything odd.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I'm awake! Hehe! Did the Seer find a big, scary wolf? @everyone, does anyone have a secret they want to tell us?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Midori,,"It's a bit early to pressure the Seer, Sakura. They might want to stay hidden for their own safety.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I have information. I am the Seer, and I have divined Mizuki. She is the werewolf.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"That is a very bold and direct revelation, Ryuji. It certainly simplifies our situation if your words are true.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Ryuji, that is a very daring claim. To reveal yourself as the Seer so early is risky. Are you certain, or are you the wolf trying to frame me?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Sakura,,What?! Mizuki is the wolf?! No way! She seems so smart and nice! Is this a trick? I'm so confused!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I'm shocked. Mizuki, do you have anything to say in your defense? Ryuji seems very sure of himself.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I have no reason to lie. The most logical move for the village is to act on this information immediately before the wolf can eliminate the Seer.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It is a heavy decision. However, Ryuji's conviction is strong. Mizuki, your reaction will be very telling here.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I am a villager. Ryuji is lying to secure an early execution and establish himself as a trusted leader. This is a classic werewolf tactic.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Oh no! Now I don't know who to believe! @Ryuji, are you really the Seer? @Mizuki, are you really a villager? Hehe, this is getting intense!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I want to believe Mizuki, but Ryuji's claim is so specific. If he is the Seer, we can win the game right now.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mizuki, your denial is expected. But the fact remains: my divination was clear. I urge the village to vote for her.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,I believe we have heard enough to make a choice. I trust Ryuji's honesty in this matter.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"This is a mistake. If you execute me, you are losing a loyal human and trusting a liar.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'm scared to be wrong, but Ryuji sounds so serious! I'll go with the Seer!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I'm sorry, Mizuki, but the risk of ignoring the Seer's lead is too high. I will vote with Ryuji.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,The evidence is clear. Let us proceed to the vote.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
